{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_010_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:016e6b1870696be9fbea3525e4006d357cb3c58f0d19af137167087f55810116",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:791b94281b02e8c34b4c385da97c2260c60339331b06f0a63db4296e06fecaa8",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！\n试镜的结果，今天会来。真的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e18d3317674ccb46d25fa11c96cf205ce99f8eaa9044f89b67049acf8b7edd0e",
      "text": "是的。不过那是合格了的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d196e09788b75156325589cf0605306ed0987c1eda5f7ca0462960ad617d6324",
      "text": "要是不合格，电话就不来吗？\n我好想电话快点打来……啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2dfdf9894f3c2e0849deb0d70163789e05e5a03bcb039e43e2ad101f16305a1",
      "text": "……！喂，您好……是的。是的……\n真的吗，非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb80b3ca487aa49277bfbcb8f04b6fecd0224da4d6404080369d05ba1e29bddf",
      "text": "太好了，皮埃尔先生。合格了！\n而且，似乎是个特别的角色哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75a2c13fd425f20a3d0695b8b70f9f8a1e1f71882a1a6dd6c95d81771618cb20",
      "text": "特别，是什么？什么意思？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:751c1b58864c9c7384b1c4e842d2ef33e0d8ebf55d38340e078abe39758eeb6c",
      "text": "听说导演和编剧从皮埃尔先生的表演中\n获得了灵感，追加了一个全新的角色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f44233db81f7a23057e0065c228ba2902f91d9ef4509900a8736f9870a8d31c",
      "text": "好像是一个被称为“击剑界王子”的\n男孩子的角色。真令人期待呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5a6c35b92f3ae95210617441c77878c40bf6262dd0d0586148df591cc28be35",
      "text": "嗯，非常非常期待！\n我合格了，好开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:979e15475dfea910ed2dbf1011e7ccd7d376fc0b03c72cdb8090b1315c0c26f7",
      "text": "我会演好给大家看的。\n我会超级加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
